1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,000
Opening Tepera

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Turning on "Idea over the feed"

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Prominent disclosure shown before
the permission request

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:26,000
User declines: the feature stays off,
the app keeps working

5
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Disclosure shown again when the user retries

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:55,000
User agrees and turns on the service
in Android settings

7
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:03,000
Feature is now active

8
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:20,000
App opened during a scrolling hour:
a suggestion instead of the feed

9
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,000
5 minutes later

10
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:38,000
After 5 minutes: gentle dim, touches still work,
the user decides ("5 more" / "Leave")

11
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:48,000
The service can be turned off
at any time in Android settings

12
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,000
End of demo
